{"seq":2,"slug":"cloud-functions","title":"Google Cloud Functions 与 Cloud Run","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/faas-platforms/cloud-functions","wordCount":1339,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"google-cloud-functions-与-cloud-run\">Google Cloud Functions 与 Cloud Run</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Google Cloud Platform（GCP）提供两种 Serverless 计算服务：Cloud Functions（FaaS）和 Cloud Run（Serverless 容器）。Cloud Functions 定位类似 AWS Lambda，以函数为部署单元；Cloud Run 基于 Knative 构建，以容器为部署单元，支持更灵活的运行时和更长的执行时间。两者共同构成 GCP Serverless 生态的核心。</p>\n<p>Cloud Run 是 GCP Serverless 战略的主力产品。它的核心理念是&quot;任何容器都能 Serverless 运行&quot;——只要容器监听 HTTP 端口，Cloud Run 就能将其作为 Serverless 服务运行，自动扩缩容（包括缩容到零）、按请求计费。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph GCP Serverless生态&#10;        A[HTTP请求] --&gt; B[Cloud Load Balancing]&#10;        B --&gt; C[Cloud Run]&#10;        B --&gt; D[Cloud Functions]&#10;        E[Pub/Sub] --&gt; D&#10;        F[Cloud Storage] --&gt; D&#10;        G[Eventarc] --&gt; C&#10;        G --&gt; D&#10;        C --&gt; H[Cloud SQL]&#10;        C --&gt; I[Firestore]&#10;        D --&gt; I&#10;        D --&gt; J[Cloud Storage]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph GCP Serverless生态\n        A[HTTP请求] --&gt; B[Cloud Load Balancing]\n        B --&gt; C[Cloud Run]\n        B --&gt; D[Cloud Functions]\n        E[Pub/Sub] --&gt; D\n        F[Cloud Storage] --&gt; D\n        G[Eventarc] --&gt; C\n        G --&gt; D\n        C --&gt; H[Cloud SQL]\n        C --&gt; I[Firestore]\n        D --&gt; I\n        D --&gt; J[Cloud Storage]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Cloud Functions (2nd gen)</th>\n<th>Cloud Run</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>部署单元</td>\n<td>函数（源代码）</td>\n<td>容器镜像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>底层引擎</td>\n<td>Cloud Run（2nd gen 实际运行在 Cloud Run 上）</td>\n<td>Knative Serving</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时</td>\n<td>Node.js, Python, Go, Java, .NET, Ruby, PHP</td>\n<td>任意（自定义容器）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大执行时长</td>\n<td>9 分钟（HTTP）/ 10 分钟（事件）</td>\n<td>60 分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发模型</td>\n<td>1（默认）或多并发</td>\n<td>多并发（默认 80，最大 1000）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大实例数</td>\n<td>3000</td>\n<td>1000（可调整）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小实例数</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0（支持缩容到零）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU 分配</td>\n<td>始终分配</td>\n<td>请求时分配 / 始终分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VPC 连接</td>\n<td>Serverless VPC Access</td>\n<td>Serverless VPC Access / Direct VPC Egress</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cloud-functions-深入解析\">Cloud Functions 深入解析</h2><p>Cloud Functions 第二代（2nd gen）基于 Cloud Run 和 Eventarc 构建，是第一代的全面升级。第二代支持更长的执行时间、更大的实例规格、并发处理和 CloudEvents 标准。</p>\n<p><strong>Functions Framework</strong> 是 Cloud Functions 的开源运行时框架，支持本地开发和测试。开发者在本地编写和调试函数，通过 <code>functions-framework</code> 启动本地服务器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { http } from &#39;@google-cloud/functions-framework&#39;;&#10;&#10;http(&#39;helloWorld&#39;, (req, res) =&gt; {&#10;  const name = req.query.name || &#39;World&#39;;&#10;  res.send(`Hello, ${name}!`);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { http } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@google-cloud/functions-framework'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'helloWorld'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">res</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> req.query.name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'World'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  res.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Hello, ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}!`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { cloudEvent, CloudEvent } from &#39;@google-cloud/functions-framework&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface PubSubData {&#10;  message: {&#10;    data: string;&#10;    attributes: Record&lt;string, string&gt;;&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;cloudEvent&lt;PubSubData&gt;(&#39;processPubSub&#39;, (event: CloudEvent&lt;PubSubData&gt;) =&gt; {&#10;  const message = event.data?.message;&#10;  if (message?.data) {&#10;    const decoded = Buffer.from(message.data, &#39;base64&#39;).toString();&#10;    console.log(`Received message: ${decoded}`);&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { cloudEvent, CloudEvent } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@google-cloud/functions-framework'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PubSubData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    attributes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cloudEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PubSubData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'processPubSub'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CloudEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PubSubData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event.data?.message;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (message?.data) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> decoded</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Buffer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(message.data, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'base64'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Received message: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">decoded</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Eventarc</strong> 是 GCP 的统一事件路由服务，连接 Cloud Audit Logs、Pub/Sub 和自定义事件到 Cloud Functions 和 Cloud Run。Eventarc 使用 CloudEvents 规范，提供标准化的事件格式和路由机制。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Eventarc 事件源</th>\n<th>触发方式</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cloud Audit Logs</td>\n<td>API 调用审计</td>\n<td>安全监控、合规</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cloud Storage</td>\n<td>对象创建/删除</td>\n<td>文件处理管道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pub/Sub</td>\n<td>消息发布</td>\n<td>异步事件处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Firebase</td>\n<td>Auth/Firestore 事件</td>\n<td>移动后端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义事件</td>\n<td>REST API 发布</td>\n<td>业务事件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cloud-run-架构与特性\">Cloud Run 架构与特性</h2><p>Cloud Run 的架构基于 Knative Serving，但在 GCP 上全托管运行。Knative 的核心抽象包括 Service、Revision、Configuration 和 Route。</p>\n<p><strong>Service</strong> 是顶层资源，定义容器镜像、环境变量、资源限制等。每次部署新版本创建一个 Revision。<strong>Route</strong> 控制流量在不同 Revision 之间的分配，支持渐进式发布。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: serving.knative.dev/v1&#10;kind: Service&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: my-api&#10;spec:&#10;  template:&#10;    metadata:&#10;      annotations:&#10;        autoscaling.knative.dev/minScale: &#39;0&#39;&#10;        autoscaling.knative.dev/maxScale: &#39;100&#39;&#10;        run.googleapis.com/cpu-throttling: &#39;false&#39;&#10;    spec:&#10;      containerConcurrency: 80&#10;      timeoutSeconds: 300&#10;      containers:&#10;        - image: gcr.io/my-project/my-api:latest&#10;          ports:&#10;            - containerPort: 8080&#10;          resources:&#10;            limits:&#10;              cpu: &#39;2&#39;&#10;              memory: 1Gi&#10;          env:&#10;            - name: DB_HOST&#10;              valueFrom:&#10;                secretKeyRef:&#10;                  name: db-credentials&#10;                  key: host\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">serving.knative.dev/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        autoscaling.knative.dev/minScale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        autoscaling.knative.dev/maxScale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'100'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run.googleapis.com/cpu-throttling</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'false'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      containerConcurrency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      timeoutSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">gcr.io/my-project/my-api:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">containerPort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8080</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            limits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1Gi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DB_HOST</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              valueFrom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                secretKeyRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">db-credentials</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                  key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">host</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>并发模型</strong>是 Cloud Run 区别于 Lambda 的核心差异。Cloud Run 允许每个实例同时处理多个请求（默认 80，最大 1000）。这意味着一个运行 Node.js/Go 的容器实例可以同时服务 80 个请求，大幅减少所需的实例数和冷启动频率。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Lambda并发模型&#10;        A1[请求1] --&gt; B1[实例1]&#10;        A2[请求2] --&gt; B2[实例2]&#10;        A3[请求3] --&gt; B3[实例3]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph CloudRun并发模型&#10;        C1[请求1] --&gt; D1[实例1]&#10;        C2[请求2] --&gt; D1&#10;        C3[请求3] --&gt; D1&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph Lambda并发模型\n        A1[请求1] --&gt; B1[实例1]\n        A2[请求2] --&gt; B2[实例2]\n        A3[请求3] --&gt; B3[实例3]\n    end\n    subgraph CloudRun并发模型\n        C1[请求1] --&gt; D1[实例1]\n        C2[请求2] --&gt; D1\n        C3[请求3] --&gt; D1\n    end</pre><p><strong>CPU 分配模式</strong>：Cloud Run 提供两种模式。&quot;仅在请求处理时分配 CPU&quot;（默认）意味着容器在无请求时 CPU 被限流，不适合后台任务。&quot;始终分配 CPU&quot;允许容器在空闲时也使用 CPU，支持后台处理，但计费更高。</p>\n<p><strong>Cloud Run Jobs</strong>：除了服务（Service），Cloud Run 还支持作业（Jobs）——运行到完成的容器任务。适合批量数据处理、ETL 管道、定时任务。Jobs 支持并行执行多个任务（最多 10000 个），每个任务运行独立的容器实例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cloud-run-高级网络与安全\">Cloud Run 高级网络与安全</h2><p><strong>Ingress 控制</strong>：Cloud Run 服务默认接受来自互联网的请求。可以配置为仅接受来自 VPC 内部或 Cloud Load Balancing 的请求，增强安全性。结合 IAM 身份验证，可以实现服务间的零信任网络。</p>\n<p><strong>VPC 连接</strong>：Cloud Run 支持两种方式连接 VPC 内部资源：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>连接方式</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>配置复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Serverless VPC Access Connector</td>\n<td>~10ms 额外</td>\n<td>$0.01/GB + 实例费用</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>通用场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Direct VPC Egress</td>\n<td>~0ms 额外</td>\n<td>无额外费用</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>延迟敏感场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Direct VPC Egress 是较新的功能，直接将 Cloud Run 实例放入 VPC 子网，消除了 VPC Access Connector 的额外延迟和成本。</p>\n<p><strong>Cloud Run 多区域部署</strong>：结合 Cloud Load Balancing，可以将 Cloud Run 服务部署到多个区域，实现全球低延迟访问。负载均衡器自动将请求路由到最近的区域。配合 Cloud CDN，静态资源在边缘缓存，动态请求路由到最近的 Cloud Run 实例。</p>\n<p><strong>Cloud Run 与 Secret Manager 集成</strong>：敏感配置（数据库密码、API Key 等）通过 Secret Manager 管理，Cloud Run 在启动时自动挂载为环境变量或文件卷。Secret Manager 支持版本控制和自动轮换，Cloud Run 可以配置在密钥更新时自动重部署。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>GCP Serverless 生态以 Cloud Functions（FaaS）和 Cloud Run（Serverless 容器）为核心</li>\n<li>Cloud Functions 2nd gen 底层运行在 Cloud Run 上，功能向 Cloud Run 看齐</li>\n<li>Cloud Run 的多并发模型（单实例 80+ 请求）比 Lambda 更高效，减少冷启动频率</li>\n<li>CPU 分配模式：请求时分配（省钱但无后台任务）vs 始终分配（支持后台处理）</li>\n<li>Eventarc 提供统一事件路由，基于 CloudEvents 标准</li>\n<li>Cloud Run Jobs 支持批量任务，最多 10000 并行任务实例</li>\n<li>Direct VPC Egress 消除 VPC 连接的额外延迟和成本</li>\n<li>多区域部署 + Cloud Load Balancing + Cloud CDN 实现全球低延迟</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Google Cloud Functions 与 Cloud Run","id":"google-cloud-functions-与-cloud-run"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Cloud Functions 深入解析","id":"cloud-functions-深入解析"},{"level":2,"text":"Cloud Run 架构与特性","id":"cloud-run-架构与特性"},{"level":2,"text":"Cloud Run 高级网络与安全","id":"cloud-run-高级网络与安全"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"AWS Lambda 深入实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/faas-platforms/aws-lambda"},"next":{"title":"边缘函数与 Edge Computing","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/faas-platforms/edge-functions"}}